From dbbb13e4b0e25c8a32a43189941d89c0e30f2f3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:30:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] osd: Ask to keep or revert layout changes from the OSD and
 applet

Picking a screen layout in the OSD or the applet applied it right away,
so a layout that left no usable screen could not be undone. Now the OSD
asks to keep the change and reverts it after 15 seconds, like the KCM.

BUG: 485285
